T*
(concentration is constant:) Tj
T*
(- dI / I = k * c * db.) Tj
T*
(Integrating over path length l: ln\(I_0 / I\) = k' * c * l => log10\(I_0 / I\) = epsilon * c) Tj
T*
(* l.) Tj
T*
(- Absorbance \(A / Optical Density\): A = log10\(I_0 / I\) = - log10\(T\) = epsilon * c) Tj
T*
(* l,) Tj
T*
